WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.100
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.267
We're hanging out with Simu Liu
right there.

00:00:03.267 --> 00:00:04.400
-Still tired. Still tired.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.000
-A little bit still, yeah.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.467
Congrats, again, on the success
of "Shang-Chi."

00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:14.100
This is a massive, massive,
massive, massive movie.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.467
-Thank you.

00:00:15.467 --> 00:00:17.968
-There must be a sequel talk
in the works or maybe not.

00:00:17.968 --> 00:00:19.434
Or we don't know?
Does Marvel let you know?

00:00:19.434 --> 00:00:22.834
-Look, I feel like there may
have a been a day and age

00:00:22.834 --> 00:00:25.067
where they brought the actors in
and they were like,

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:27.234
"Hey, buddy, here's everything
that's going to happen."

00:00:27.234 --> 00:00:30.167
But I just feel like there were
certain things that happened

00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:32.334
that ruined it for all of us,
so...

00:00:32.334 --> 00:00:34.634
I don't want to single anybody
out, but, you know,

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:36.501
shout-out to Holland,
shout-out to Ruffalo.

00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:38.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.801 --> 00:00:40.667
They really just mucked it up
for the rest of us.

00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:42.901
So, no, no, we have no idea.

00:00:42.901 --> 00:00:44.534
-You're also doing
a really cool thing

00:00:44.534 --> 00:00:47.801
on Thanksgiving Day
with "Sesame Street."

00:00:47.801 --> 00:00:50.133
Can you let everyone know
what you're doing?

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:53.734
-Yeah, well, we are doing
kind of a special episode

00:00:53.734 --> 00:00:55.567
kind of centered on AAPI issues.

00:00:55.567 --> 00:00:57.167
And we're actually introducing

00:00:57.167 --> 00:00:59.801
the very first
Asian American muppet.

00:00:59.801 --> 00:01:02.934
Her name is Ji-Young.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:02.934 --> 00:01:05.501
Yeah.
-There's you.

00:01:05.501 --> 00:01:08.767
That's cool. Come on.

00:01:08.767 --> 00:01:10.133
-It's just so incredible.

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:11.701
I mean, it's not every day,
first of all,

00:01:11.701 --> 00:01:15.100
that you get to see faces, you
know, certain faces on screen.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.267
And now we have it
in muppet form.

00:01:17.267 --> 00:01:20.834
And kids everywhere will get to
kind of enjoy and hang out with

00:01:20.834 --> 00:01:24.601
Ji-Young and learn her name and
her culture and all that stuff.

00:01:24.601 --> 00:01:27.234
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Dude, I'm so --

00:01:27.234 --> 00:01:28.734
I'm so excited.

00:01:28.734 --> 00:01:32.267
And again, I want you to break
a leg on "Saturday Night Live."

00:01:32.267 --> 00:01:35.334
Are you nervous at all?

00:01:35.334 --> 00:01:37.434
-I am a little bit.

00:01:37.434 --> 00:01:38.634
-You have to be
a little nervous.

00:01:38.634 --> 00:01:39.734
But you're a performer.

00:01:39.734 --> 00:01:41.167
-I'm such a big fan
of your work.

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:45.033
And I know that your impressions
are just world class.

00:01:45.033 --> 00:01:47.634
And so, in my -- like, I had
a Zoom call on Monday

00:01:47.634 --> 00:01:50.234
where they were like, "Hey, give
us any ideas that you have."

00:01:50.234 --> 00:01:53.534
And I was kind of like, "Well, I
have prepared some impressions."

00:01:53.534 --> 00:01:55.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.601 --> 00:01:58.167
And -- And none of them made it.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.167 --> 00:02:01.534
-Okay. Okay.
But are these impressions of --

00:02:01.534 --> 00:02:04.567
-Well, yeah, like, you do, like,
these really cool, like,

00:02:04.567 --> 00:02:06.634
pop culture celebrity
impressions.

00:02:06.634 --> 00:02:09.634
And I, you know, mine are not
exactly that.

00:02:09.634 --> 00:02:11.667
-Can you give me an example of
an impression?

00:02:11.667 --> 00:02:14.601
-Yeah. So I do, like,
an Emperor Palpatine.

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:16.000
[ Laughter ]
Like, that's what I --

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.167
[ Cheers ]

00:02:17.167 --> 00:02:19.000
-You do Emperor Pal--
-I do Emperor Palpatine.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.300
So, you know,
it's something like...

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:22.400
-I'm going to close my eyes.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:26.467
-[ Deep voice ] "Something,
something, something dark side."

00:02:26.467 --> 00:02:28.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:34.267
"I am very excited to be hosting
'Saturday Night Live.'"

00:02:34.267 --> 00:02:36.367
-Wow. And, so, they didn't bite
on that one?

00:02:36.367 --> 00:02:37.901
-[ Normal voice ]
They did not bite on it.

00:02:37.901 --> 00:02:41.200
Honestly, I didn't want to say,
I'm a little offended.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:43.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.734 --> 00:02:45.200
-What other ones did you throw
by them?

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.868
-So then I was like, well, for
sure they would go for Gollum.

00:02:47.868 --> 00:02:51.000
They would go for Gollum,
'cause I practiced Gollum.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.267
You know, I like to think that
I'm a pretty good one.

00:02:53.267 --> 00:02:55.267
So it goes a little something
like this.

00:02:55.267 --> 00:02:56.901
[ Clears throat ]

00:02:56.901 --> 00:02:59.467
[ as Gollum ] Those tricksy
little Hobbitses.

00:02:59.467 --> 00:03:01.434
Master tricks us.

00:03:01.434 --> 00:03:03.501
Master deceives us.

00:03:03.501 --> 00:03:05.400
Master loves Jimmy Fallon."
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:06.701
-I like that! I like that!

00:03:06.701 --> 00:03:07.834
-[ Normal voice ]
Well, thank you.

00:03:07.834 --> 00:03:11.067
-I like that!
-Thank you.

00:03:11.067 --> 00:03:13.701
-Simu Liu, I love you, buddy.
Break a leg this Saturday.

00:03:13.701 --> 00:03:14.901
-Thank you so much.

00:03:14.901 --> 00:03:16.667
-"Shang-Chi and the Legend
of the Ten Rings"

00:03:16.667 --> 00:03:18.501
is streaming now on Disney+.

00:03:18.501 --> 00:03:21.734
Check him out on "Saturday Night
Live" this Saturday.

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:23.300
You'll see none of
these impressions.

